{"seq":1,"slug":"disk-io-optimization","title":"磁盘 I/O 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/disk-io-optimization","wordCount":1151,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"磁盘-i-o-优化\">磁盘 I/O 优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>磁盘 I/O 是大多数应用系统中速度最慢的组件。即使是现代 NVMe SSD，其随机读取延迟（~100μs）仍然比 DRAM 访问（~100ns）慢三个数量级。对于数据库、日志系统、文件服务器等 I/O 密集型应用，磁盘 I/O 优化直接决定了系统的吞吐量上限。优化的核心思路是：<strong>减少 I/O 次数、增大每次 I/O 的效率、选择合适的存储策略</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[磁盘 I/O 优化] --&gt; B[减少 I/O 次数]&#10;    A --&gt; C[优化 I/O 模式]&#10;    A --&gt; D[选择合适硬件]&#10;    B --&gt; E[缓存层]&#10;    B --&gt; F[批量写入]&#10;    C --&gt; G[顺序优于随机]&#10;    C --&gt; H[合并小 I/O]&#10;    D --&gt; I[HDD vs SSD vs NVMe]&#10;    D --&gt; J[文件系统选择]\">graph TB\n    A[磁盘 I/O 优化] --&gt; B[减少 I/O 次数]\n    A --&gt; C[优化 I/O 模式]\n    A --&gt; D[选择合适硬件]\n    B --&gt; E[缓存层]\n    B --&gt; F[批量写入]\n    C --&gt; G[顺序优于随机]\n    C --&gt; H[合并小 I/O]\n    D --&gt; I[HDD vs SSD vs NVMe]\n    D --&gt; J[文件系统选择]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储类型</th>\n<th>顺序读吞吐量</th>\n<th>随机读 IOPS</th>\n<th>随机读延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HDD (7200 RPM)</td>\n<td>~150 MB/s</td>\n<td>~100</td>\n<td>~10 ms</td>\n<td>冷数据归档、大文件顺序读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SATA SSD</td>\n<td>~550 MB/s</td>\n<td>~90,000</td>\n<td>~100 μs</td>\n<td>通用服务器存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NVMe SSD</td>\n<td>~3,500 MB/s</td>\n<td>~500,000</td>\n<td>~20 μs</td>\n<td>数据库、高性能存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intel Optane</td>\n<td>~2,500 MB/s</td>\n<td>~500,000</td>\n<td>~10 μs</td>\n<td>超低延迟场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存 (DDR4)</td>\n<td>~50,000 MB/s</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>~100 ns</td>\n<td>缓存、内存数据库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"顺序-i-o-与随机-i-o\">顺序 I/O 与随机 I/O</h2><p>理解顺序 I/O 和随机 I/O 的性能差异是磁盘优化的基础。对于 HDD，顺序读写可以达到 150MB/s，但随机读写只有约 1MB/s——差距超过 <strong>100 倍</strong>。即使对于 SSD，顺序读写的吞吐量也是随机读写的 3-5 倍。</p>\n<p>原因在于存储设备的物理特性。HDD 需要机械寻道（磁头移动）和旋转等待，每次随机访问的寻道时间约 5-10ms。SSD 虽然没有机械部件，但 NAND Flash 的读写粒度是<strong>页</strong>（通常 4-16KB），擦除粒度是<strong>块</strong>（通常 256KB-4MB），随机小写入会触发读-改-写放大。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 fio 测试顺序 vs 随机 I/O 性能&#10;# 顺序读&#10;fio --name=seqread --rw=read --bs=128k --size=1G --numjobs=1 \\&#10;    --ioengine=libaio --direct=1 --runtime=30&#10;&#10;# 随机读&#10;fio --name=randread --rw=randread --bs=4k --size=1G --numjobs=1 \\&#10;    --ioengine=libaio --direct=1 --runtime=30&#10;&#10;# 典型 NVMe SSD 结果:&#10;# 顺序读: ~3200 MB/s&#10;# 随机读: ~800 MB/s (4K), ~60万 IOPS\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 fio 测试顺序 vs 随机 I/O 性能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 顺序读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fio</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name=seqread</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rw=read</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bs=128k</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --size=1G</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --numjobs=1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --ioengine=libaio</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --direct=1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --runtime=30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 随机读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fio</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name=randread</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rw=randread</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bs=4k</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --size=1G</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --numjobs=1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --ioengine=libaio</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --direct=1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --runtime=30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 典型 NVMe SSD 结果:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 顺序读: ~3200 MB/s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 随机读: ~800 MB/s (4K), ~60万 IOPS</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将随机 I/O 转换为顺序 I/O 的经典技术：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// WAL (Write-Ahead Log): 将随机写转换为顺序追加&#10;struct WAL {&#10;    int fd;&#10;    char *buffer;&#10;    size_t buf_size;&#10;    size_t buf_offset;&#10;};&#10;&#10;int wal_append(struct WAL *wal, const void *data, size_t len) {&#10;    if (wal-&gt;buf_offset + len &gt; wal-&gt;buf_size) {&#10;        write(wal-&gt;fd, wal-&gt;buffer, wal-&gt;buf_offset);  // 刷盘&#10;        wal-&gt;buf_offset = 0;&#10;    }&#10;    memcpy(wal-&gt;buffer + wal-&gt;buf_offset, data, len);&#10;    wal-&gt;buf_offset += len;&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// WAL (Write-Ahead Log): 将随机写转换为顺序追加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WAL {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fd;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">buffer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    size_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buf_size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    size_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buf_offset;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wal_append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">wal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">size_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (wal->buf_offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wal->buf_size) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(wal->fd, wal->buffer, wal->buf_offset);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 刷盘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        wal->buf_offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    memcpy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(wal->buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wal->buf_offset, data, len);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    wal->buf_offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数据库系统广泛使用的 <strong>LSM-Tree</strong>（Log-Structured Merge Tree）就是基于这个思想：所有写入先追加到内存表（MemTable），写满后作为排序文件（SSTable）顺序刷盘，后台异步合并。这种设计将随机写转化为了顺序写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓冲与预读策略\">缓冲与预读策略</h2><p>操作系统的<strong>页缓存</strong>（Page Cache）是磁盘 I/O 最重要的优化层。Linux 会将读取过的文件数据缓存在内存中，后续对相同数据的读取直接从内存返回，不触发磁盘 I/O。同时，内核的<strong>预读</strong>（Read-Ahead）机制会在检测到顺序读模式时，提前将后续数据读入缓存。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看页缓存使用情况&#10;free -h | grep &quot;buff/cache&quot;&#10;&#10;# 调整预读大小（默认通常 128KB）&#10;blockdev --getra /dev/sda       # 查看当前预读大小（单位: 512B 扇区）&#10;blockdev --setra 2048 /dev/sda  # 设置为 1MB (2048 * 512B)&#10;&#10;# 使用 vmtouch 查看文件在页缓存中的状态&#10;vmtouch -v /var/lib/mysql/data/mydb/mytable.ibd\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看页缓存使用情况</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">free</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"buff/cache\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 调整预读大小（默认通常 128KB）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">blockdev</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --getra</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/sda</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 查看当前预读大小（单位: 512B 扇区）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">blockdev</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --setra</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2048</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/sda</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 设置为 1MB (2048 * 512B)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 vmtouch 查看文件在页缓存中的状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vmtouch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/lib/mysql/data/mydb/mytable.ibd</span></span></code></pre></div><p>应用层的缓冲策略同样重要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;&#10;&#10;void write_unbuffered(const char *path, int n) {&#10;    FILE *f = fopen(path, &quot;w&quot;);&#10;    setvbuf(f, NULL, _IONBF, 0);  // 无缓冲&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;        fprintf(f, &quot;%d\\n&quot;, i);  // 每次 fprintf 触发一次系统调用&#10;    }&#10;    fclose(f);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void write_buffered(const char *path, int n) {&#10;    FILE *f = fopen(path, &quot;w&quot;);&#10;    char buf[65536];&#10;    setvbuf(f, buf, _IOFBF, sizeof(buf));  // 64KB 全缓冲&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;        fprintf(f, &quot;%d\\n&quot;, i);  // 缓冲区满才触发系统调用&#10;    }&#10;    fclose(f);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;stdio.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> write_unbuffered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> char</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    FILE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fopen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setvbuf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, _IONBF, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 无缓冲</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        fprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, i);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 每次 fprintf 触发一次系统调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fclose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> write_buffered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> char</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    FILE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fopen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65536</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setvbuf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f, buf, _IOFBF, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf));</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 64KB 全缓冲</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        fprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, i);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 缓冲区满才触发系统调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fclose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[应用写入] --&gt; B[用户空间缓冲区]&#10;    B --&gt;|缓冲区满/flush| C[内核页缓存]&#10;    C --&gt;|回写策略| D[磁盘]&#10;    E[应用读取] --&gt; F{页缓存命中?}&#10;    F --&gt;|命中| G[直接返回]&#10;    F --&gt;|未命中| H[磁盘读取]&#10;    H --&gt; I[存入页缓存]&#10;    I --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[应用写入] --&gt; B[用户空间缓冲区]\n    B --&gt;|缓冲区满/flush| C[内核页缓存]\n    C --&gt;|回写策略| D[磁盘]\n    E[应用读取] --&gt; F{页缓存命中?}\n    F --&gt;|命中| G[直接返回]\n    F --&gt;|未命中| H[磁盘读取]\n    H --&gt; I[存入页缓存]\n    I --&gt; G</pre><p>对于<strong>绕过页缓存</strong>的场景（如数据库引擎自己管理缓存），使用 <code>O_DIRECT</code> 标志直接读写磁盘：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"int fd = open(&quot;/data/dbfile&quot;, O_RDWR | O_DIRECT);&#10;void *buf;&#10;posix_memalign(&amp;buf, 4096, 4096);  // O_DIRECT 要求对齐的缓冲区&#10;pread(fd, buf, 4096, offset);      // 绕过页缓存直接读取\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/data/dbfile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, O_RDWR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> O_DIRECT);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">buf;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">posix_memalign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // O_DIRECT 要求对齐的缓冲区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fd, buf, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 绕过页缓存直接读取</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"i-o-调度与合并\">I/O 调度与合并</h2><p>Linux 内核的 <strong>I/O 调度器</strong>负责对应用提交的 I/O 请求进行排序和合并，以优化磁盘访问模式。不同的调度器适合不同的存储设备：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调度器</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用设备</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>mq-deadline</td>\n<td>保证请求延迟上限，排序合并</td>\n<td>HDD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bfq (Budget Fair Queuing)</td>\n<td>公平带宽分配，低延迟</td>\n<td>HDD, 桌面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>none (noop)</td>\n<td>不做排序，仅合并</td>\n<td>NVMe SSD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kyber</td>\n<td>轻量级，面向 SSD 优化</td>\n<td>高速 SSD</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看当前调度器&#10;cat /sys/block/sda/queue/scheduler&#10;&#10;# 切换调度器&#10;echo &quot;mq-deadline&quot; &gt; /sys/block/sda/queue/scheduler&#10;&#10;# NVMe SSD 建议使用 none&#10;echo &quot;none&quot; &gt; /sys/block/nvme0n1/queue/scheduler&#10;&#10;# 调整 I/O 合并参数&#10;echo 256 &gt; /sys/block/sda/queue/nr_requests     # 队列深度&#10;echo 2 &gt; /sys/block/sda/queue/rq_affinity       # I/O 完成在提交的 CPU 上处理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看当前调度器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/block/sda/queue/scheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 切换调度器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"mq-deadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/block/sda/queue/scheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># NVMe SSD 建议使用 none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/block/nvme0n1/queue/scheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 调整 I/O 合并参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 256</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/block/sda/queue/nr_requests</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 队列深度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/block/sda/queue/rq_affinity</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # I/O 完成在提交的 CPU 上处理</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>I/O 合并</strong>（I/O Merging）是调度器的关键优化。当两个相邻的 I/O 请求访问连续的磁盘地址时，调度器将它们合并为一个大请求，减少磁盘操作次数。使用 <code>iostat</code> 可以观察合并效果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"iostat -xz 1&#10;# rrqm/s wrqm/s: 每秒合并的读/写请求数&#10;# 如果 wrqm/s 很高，说明应用的写入模式适合合并&#10;# 如果 wrqm/s 接近 0，可能需要在应用层做写入合并\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iostat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -xz</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># rrqm/s wrqm/s: 每秒合并的读/写请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果 wrqm/s 很高，说明应用的写入模式适合合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果 wrqm/s 接近 0，可能需要在应用层做写入合并</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"文件系统选择与配置\">文件系统选择与配置</h2><p>文件系统是应用和磁盘之间的抽象层，不同文件系统在元数据管理、日志机制和分配策略上有显著差异。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# ext4: Linux 默认，成熟稳定&#10;mkfs.ext4 -O ^has_journal /dev/sda1           # 禁用日志（纯读场景）&#10;mount -o noatime,nodiratime,discard /dev/sda1  # 禁用访问时间记录&#10;&#10;# XFS: 大文件和高并发场景优秀&#10;mkfs.xfs -f /dev/sda1&#10;mount -o noatime,logbufs=8 /dev/sda1&#10;&#10;# 通用性能挂载选项&#10;mount -o noatime       # 不更新文件访问时间（减少写入）&#10;mount -o nodiratime    # 不更新目录访问时间&#10;mount -o discard       # SSD TRIM 支持&#10;mount -o barrier=0     # 禁用写屏障（危险但更快，需 UPS）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ext4: Linux 默认，成熟稳定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkfs.ext4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -O</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ^has_journal</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/sda1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 禁用日志（纯读场景）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> noatime,nodiratime,discard</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/sda1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 禁用访问时间记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># XFS: 大文件和高并发场景优秀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkfs.xfs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/sda1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> noatime,logbufs=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/sda1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 通用性能挂载选项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> noatime</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 不更新文件访问时间（减少写入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nodiratime</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 不更新目录访问时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> discard</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # SSD TRIM 支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> barrier=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 禁用写屏障（危险但更快，需 UPS）</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件系统</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ext4</td>\n<td>稳定成熟，广泛支持</td>\n<td>大目录性能较差</td>\n<td>通用服务器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XFS</td>\n<td>大文件高并发优秀，延迟分配</td>\n<td>不支持缩容</td>\n<td>数据库、大文件存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Btrfs</td>\n<td>快照、压缩、校验和</td>\n<td>性能不稳定</td>\n<td>需要快照的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZFS</td>\n<td>端到端校验、压缩、去重</td>\n<td>内存消耗大</td>\n<td>数据完整性要求高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((磁盘 I/O 优化))&#10;    存储特性&#10;      HDD vs SSD vs NVMe&#10;      顺序 vs 随机&#10;      读写不对称&#10;    I/O 模式&#10;      WAL 顺序追加&#10;      LSM-Tree&#10;      批量写入&#10;    缓存策略&#10;      页缓存&#10;      预读&#10;      O_DIRECT&#10;      应用层缓冲&#10;    系统调优&#10;      I/O 调度器&#10;      请求合并&#10;      文件系统选择&#10;      挂载选项\">mindmap\n  root((磁盘 I/O 优化))\n    存储特性\n      HDD vs SSD vs NVMe\n      顺序 vs 随机\n      读写不对称\n    I/O 模式\n      WAL 顺序追加\n      LSM-Tree\n      批量写入\n    缓存策略\n      页缓存\n      预读\n      O_DIRECT\n      应用层缓冲\n    系统调优\n      I/O 调度器\n      请求合并\n      文件系统选择\n      挂载选项</pre><ul>\n<li>磁盘 I/O 是最慢的系统组件，<strong>顺序 I/O 比随机 I/O 快 10-100 倍</strong>（取决于设备类型）</li>\n<li><strong>将随机写转换为顺序写</strong>（WAL、LSM-Tree）是数据库和日志系统的核心设计模式</li>\n<li><strong>页缓存</strong>是最重要的 I/O 优化层，但数据库引擎通常使用 O_DIRECT 自己管理缓存</li>\n<li><strong>I/O 调度器</strong>应根据存储设备类型选择：HDD 用 mq-deadline，NVMe SSD 用 none</li>\n<li><strong>文件系统和挂载选项</strong>对 I/O 性能有显著影响，<code>noatime</code> 和正确的调度器是基础配置</li>\n<li>I/O 优化的思路：<strong>缓存 &gt; 批量 &gt; 顺序化 &gt; 硬件升级</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"磁盘 I/O 优化","id":"磁盘-i-o-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"顺序 I/O 与随机 I/O","id":"顺序-i-o-与随机-i-o"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲与预读策略","id":"缓冲与预读策略"},{"level":2,"text":"I/O 调度与合并","id":"i-o-调度与合并"},{"level":2,"text":"文件系统选择与配置","id":"文件系统选择与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内存泄漏检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/memory-optimization/memory-leak-detection"},"next":{"title":"网络优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/network-optimization"}}